<title>USA: Interlake Corp to acquire assets.</title>
<headline>Interlake Corp to acquire assets.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interlake Corp said Tuesday it signed a letter of intent to purchase the assets of ARC Metals Inc of Ridgway, Pa.</p>
<p>ARC Metals specializes in the custom blending and recycling of ferrous metal powders for the metal powders industry.</p>
<p>The proposed purchase is subject to the approval of Interlake's bank group and the satisfactory completion of its due diligence.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
